      "id": "claim_8726f27a9d394749af7f84cf2e263861",
      "statement": "The ruleset's stated scope is delivering the Yarn CLI only: Yarn commands do not become Bazel actions, so they receive no caching, sandboxing or dependency-installation guarantees from Bazel.",
